 248:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/lstm_eval.h **** // Calculates a single LSTM gate.
 249:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/lstm_eval.h **** // Implements the following formula:
